SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agia Paraskevi\, Pollonia
LOCATION:Pollonia\, Milos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Pollonia's fishing-village feast: vespers at Agia Paraskevi on the evening of 25 July\, then a free musical evening from about 21:30 with island music\, organised by the Pollonia cultural and beautification society. Crowds are a mix of locals and visitors staying in the village\; book a table at one of the harbour tavernas beforehand\, because they fill up on the night.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/milos/#pollonia-panigiri-of-agia-paraskevi-pollonia
